<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Pre-Raid Best in Slot Gear list for Blood Death Knight Tanks in Wrath of the Lich King Classic for Phase 3. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from Heroics, reputation rewards, and the new 10-man Raid loot added to Titan Rune Dungeons.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot-gear">Blood Death Knight Tank Best in Slot Gear, Gems, and Enchants - Pre-Raid Phase 3</h2>Blizzard is mixing things up again, but adding another Heroic Plus difficulty (Heroic Plus Plus?) titled Beta Titan Rune Dungeons. Last iteration was Alpha Titan Rune Dungeons, which dropped Naxxramas 10-man gear. This new iteration drops 10-man Ulduar gear, and now the last boss of each dungeon drops <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=2589/sidereal-essence">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_icediamond_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sidereal Essence</span></span></a> which can be turned in for Ulduar 10-man Hardmode loot. What this means is, you can get pretty strong without ever stepping foot in a raid. Definitely a positive for the more casual playerbase.<br/>
<br/>
<div style="text-align: -webkit-center;">
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="blood-death-knight-tank-pre-raid-bis">Blood Death Knight Tank - Pre-Raid BIS</h4>
<b>Healing Optimization: 8394 TPS - 2772 DPS - 4454 DTPS - 178.769 EHP (Patchwerk)</b>
<br/>
<b>Threat Optimization: 13,240 TPS - 3249 DPS - 4422 DTPS - 178.769 EHP (Patchwerk)</b></div>
