<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_29.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Regal Twilight Opal</span></a> &gt; <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40162/accurate-ametrine">
