<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_30.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Accurate Monarch Topaz</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Yellow Socket - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40166/vivid-eye-of-zul">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_41.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vivid Eye of Zul</span></a> &gt; <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40167/enduring-eye-of-zul">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_41.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enduring Eye of Zul</span></a> &gt; <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40168/steady-eye-of-zul">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_41.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Steady Eye of Zul</span></a> &gt; <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40088/vivid-forest-emerald">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_25.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vivid Forest Emerald</span></a> &gt; <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40089/enduring-forest-emerald">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_25.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enduring Forest Emerald</span></a> &gt; <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40090/steady-forest-emerald">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_25.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Steady Forest Emerald</span></a> &gt; <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40162/accurate-ametrine">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_39.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Accurate Ametrine</span></a> &gt; <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40058/accurate-monarch-topaz">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_30.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Accurate Monarch Topaz</span></a></div></li></ul>There are a ton of options for gemming as a Blood Death Knight. It can get a tad bit confusing, So I'll cover some of the stipulations below.<ul>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">If you don't have 7% Hit in a raid environment, you'll gem it until you're there.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">If you don't have 26 Expertise, you'll gem it until you're there.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">If you're not uncrittable (5.6% crit reduction), you'll gem Defense or Resilience. Resilience requires less investment in it as a stat to achieve this, but it also doesn't give any avoidance which Defense does.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">If you're all of the above, and are tanking easy content, you'll gem Strength/<wbr/>Stam.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">If you're tanking hard content, you'll just gem Straight Stamina in all of your sockets regardless of color.</div></li></ul>
<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-enchants">Best Enchants for Blood Death Knight Tanks - Pre-Raid Phase 3</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Head - <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=67839/mind-amplification-dish">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mind Amplification Dish</span></a> &gt; <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44150/arcanum-of-the-stalwart-protector">
